    "collapsible_tabs_Yq864N": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "item_3WpDxh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How does the Library Subscription work? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Step 1: 📚🧸You can subscribe to any plan from our website. </p><p>Step 2: 📲Download the neOwn app to select your books or toys. </p><p>Step 3: 📦Books/toys will be delivered and the pickup and exchange will happen after maximum 30 days</p><p>Step 4: 🔁Finally you return and repeat the same for all the following months of your subscription!</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_QhiRpM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "What if I damage a Library Book? What if I lose a Library Book? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>If the damage is minor and can be repaired by us, there will be no additional charge to you.</p><p>If the damage is major such that it cannot be circulated anymore, or if the book is lost/misplaced, we will charge you 40% of the MRP of the item (and you can keep the item).</p><p>neOwn trusts moms to take the utmost care of books so that we can all collectively enjoy them!</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_8FWpPP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "There’s no place to enter my child’s details on the website, how will you know what kind of books I want? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Our app asks for all these details to create a profile for your child. </p><p>Once you subscribe to any plan, you have to log in to our neOwn App to select your books. </p><p>Before you can view the catalog on the app, you have to enter all your child’s details - including their age, so that we can provide an age-appropriate catalog for them. </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_y3mAD8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "If I subscribe today, will my 30 days start now? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>No, your 30 days will start after the books have been delivered to you. </p><p>Once you subscribe, you have to download our app to select your books. After selection, they will be delivered in 2-5 days within Mumbai and 4-8 days outside Mumbai. </p><p>Your 30 days start from the day when the books are delivered. </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_W4zMEU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How can someone redeem the gift card?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p><strong>How to Redeem Your neOwn Gift Card:</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Scan the QR Code</strong> on your gift card (this takes you to the neOwn website)</li><li><strong>Select the Plan</strong> - Choose the exact plan name and duration mentioned on your gift card</li><li><strong>Fill in Details</strong> - Complete the required information and place your order</li><li><strong>Code Applies at Checkout</strong> - Your voucher will automatically get redeemed when you checkout</li></ol><p><strong>Important Notes:</strong><br/>⏰ Gift card must be activated within 30 days from purchase date<br/>📍 Toy delivery available only in Mumbai<br/>📚 Book delivery available across India</p><p><strong>Need Help?</strong><br/>WhatsApp us at +91 93244 55972</p><p><strong>What happens next?</strong><br/>Once redeemed, you'll get access to select 5 books monthly from our 45,000+ catalog, plus join our community for book recommendations, expert sessions, and fun activities!</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_HCE48n": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "header": "Do I have to return the products?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>We’ll send our delivery partner directly to your doorstep for the delivery and the pickup of the items. All you have to do is be available to receive the delivery and keep the items packed when it's time for the pickup.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_bWUjEw": {
          "type": "item",
